From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000004 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gino (WLTB-Gino) <gino@wltechblog.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Oct 2026 03:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] motor: port the thingino unified module-param interface to 4.4.94

The 4.4.94 GPIO/TCU motor driver predates the unified param interface the
3.10.14 driver and package/thingino-motors's S59motor already speak
(hmaxstep/vmaxstep/tcu_channels/hst1-4/vst1-4/motor_switch_gpio/
invert_gpio_dir). Without it the module silently ignores modprobe
parameters and drives its compiled-in reference-board pins, so a 4.4.94
PTZ head (T40/T41) gets the wrong coils. Port the interface from
thingino/ingenic-sdk (already upstream there), with hmin/hmax/vmin/vmax
defaulting disabled (switch-less heads) and the reference-board limit
pull-ups only asserted when a limit GPIO is actually configured.

---
  1 file changed, 170 insertions(+), 32 deletions(-)

diff --git a/common/misc/motor/motor.c b/common/misc/motor/motor.c
index a3a49ac..740bbbb 100644
--- a/common/misc/motor/motor.c
+++ b/common/misc/motor/motor.c
@@ -1,9 +1,17 @@
